  "reason": "The strongest evidence so far is RNA-only multiprofile with avgpool and PCA, which outperforms transformer aggregation and scGPT avgpool. The main uncertainty is whether the untested scVI RNA representation can improve on PCA/scGPT under this same strong setting. config_005 changes only the RNA encoder relative to the best RNA-only setup, cleanly isolating the representation effect. This is an efficient next experiment because it exploits the promising multiprofile+avgpool direction, may identify a better RNA base for later multimodal tests, and avoids confounding the result by adding image fusion at the same time."
